         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Purpose: The potential of large language models in medicine for education and decision-making purposes has been demonstrated as they have achieved decent scores on medical exams such as the United States Medical Licensing Exam (USMLE) and the MedQA exam.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
